# Blog page motion

**Before editing `BlogPageDecor`, motion presets, or blog list/detail interactions, read:**

`guidelines/agent-devlog-blog-motion.md`

**Index:** `guidelines/agent-devlog-index.md`

## Quick rules

- **Single module:** `src/app/components/BlogPageMotion.tsx` — do not duplicate home float markup in pages
- **Presets:** `blogCardMotion`, `blogButtonMotion`, `blogReveal`, `MotionSection`, `PlayfulBlogTitle`
- **Seeds:** `BlogPageDecor` `seed` prop drives deterministic layout variation
- **Test:** http://localhost:5300/endtoend-engineer/blogs and `/blogs/1`
